  "id": 1114,
  "description": "## Calmshore\nCalmshore is a casual, non-competitive guild with no strict contribution requirements.\n\nWe accept players who enjoy relaxed incremental gameplay and want access to basic guild activities and mechanics (raid, challenge, repair maintenance, energizing Pools bonus) without pressure.  \n\nWe expect members to participate or contribute at their own pace — every little bit helps.\n\nJoining Requirement: Combat Lv. 50\n\nDue to prolonged non-participation from past members, members are now required to participate in any guild activity at least once every 3 weeks.\n\nKick: After 4 days of profile inactivity or 3 weeks of guild inactivity.\nYou will be sent a final notice before being kicked.\n\nRaid: 2x Daily - Discord has role ping.  \nOrbit of the Forgotton (Combat Lv.80) (60 minutes) - Celestial Observatory\n\n1st Raid: PST 6pm, CST 8pm, EST 9pm, UTC 1am, AWST 9am  \n2nd Raid: PST 7am, CST 9am, EST 10am, UTC 2pm, AWST 10pm\n\nEnergizing Pools activated on SAT &amp; SUN (America) / SUN &amp; MON (Eurasia) after 1st raid.  \n(SAT/SUN) PST 7pm, CST9pm, EST 10pm, (SUN/MON) UTC 2am, AWST 10am  \n\nOur Discord: https://discord.gg/Np2jQR4BCz\n\nCurrent Goal:  \nComplete Guild Challenges to afford weekly Guild Raids &amp; Energizing Pools  \nMaintain Repair Material in Stockpile\n\n[HISTORY]  \n20251212 Guild Established, transferred from &#039;Harem Kings&#039; Guild  \n20260207 Guild Lv. 60  \n20260323 Guild Lv. 70  \n20260403 Built Energizing Pools  \n20260608 Guild Lv. 80  \n20260803 Guild Lv. 85  \n\n### | GUILD BOARD |\n\n[GUILD MARKS]  \nEach completed Guild Challenge add 1 mark. A raid cost 3 marks &amp; Energizing Pools  cost 5 marks per activation.\n\n[CONTRIBUTION]  \nContribute at your own pace.  \n- Join a raid. (Lv. 70 raid rewards 2.1k gold, 23k Combat EXP, 25k Guild Mastery EXP)\n- Contribute to Guild Challenge. We appreciate all the help we can get.\n- Deposit to Stockpile to repair guild components as soon as possible to save cost.\n\n[REPAIR &amp; STOCKPILE]\nGuild components are best repair at near 80%\n\nMission Table (Stockpile quantity on 07 Sept 26)  \n754 Oak Log (11137)  \n754 Birch Log (31682)  \n754 Banyan Log (30324)  \n1,006 Willow Log (11182)  \n754 Mahogany Log (17576)  \n754 Lead Bar (5337)  \n754 Steel Bar (4819)  \nRepair Stock: 5x\n\nEnergizing Pools  \n2,500 Spruce Log (4995)  \n2,500 Maple Log (33826)  \n1,500 Mystical Log (15188)  \n1,500 Iron Bar (7993)  \n1,500 Mercury Bar (5156)  \n1,500 Uranium Bar (11006)  \nRepair Stock: 3x\n\nBoth Mission Table and Energizing Pools is repairing. Repair &amp; Stockpile list updated, we are good for 2+ months. Thanks you very much for depositing a lot this week!\n\n### | Posted on 20260831 |\n\nThank you for last week&#039;s Contributors:  \nWrenidall, DreadChaos, Eiruna, Minutiae, Radiumgirl, Prosektikos, Emmibaby, Snuggles ShadowVoid, Yaalt\n\nAnd those who check our stockpile:  \nG333, Owaeka\n\n### | Posted on 20260907 |\n\nRidiculous is our new member. Welcome to the guild!\n\nLast week&#039;s contributors to our Guild Challenge are:\nWrenidall, Prosektikos, P00pspanker, WOLFF, Przebiegly, G333, Owaeka, Yaalt, Radiumgirl, Emmybaby, zerokai 2\n\nAnd those who contribute to our stockpile:  \nEiruna, WOLFF, zerokai 2\n\nMission Tables and Energizing Pools were repaired earlier last week. We have 3x repairs worth of stockpile. Thanks you!\n\nIt has been uneventful since Moonlit Festival, there has been no new update since. It will be a long while idling until the next event is set to be &quot;Eyes of Shadows&quot; late October.",
